<title>USA: Syquest sees higher Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>Syquest sees higher Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc said on Thursday that it expects to report a &quot;significantly&quot; higher loss on &quot;significantly&quot; reduced revenues for its second quarter ended March 30, compared to the previous quarter.</p>
<p>The company also said that four major suppliers have converted $14 million of debt into SyQuest common stock.</p>
<p>For the quarter ended December 31, 1996, SyQuest reported a loss of $0.86 a share on revenues of $48.3 million.</p>
</text>
